{title: Adhir Man Zale}
{artist: Shreya Ghoshal Ajay Atul}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Adhir man [Dm]jhaa [A]le,        [A]madhur ghan [Dm]aa [A]le
[A]Dhukyaa [Dm]tuni [A]nabhaa [Dm]tale,        [Dm]sakhya [A]priya
[F]Sarituni [G]surel dhund swar,        he [Dm]aale [A]
[Am]Mi asha [E]rangaa [Am]chi,        [Am]motiya [E]angaa [Am]chi
Kewadya [A]gandhaa [G]chi,        baharale [E]na
[Am]Umagale [E]raanaa [Am]la,        [Am]dethhaala [E]paanaa [Am]la
Maajhya [A]saradaaraa [G]la,        samajale [E]na
[Am]Ala re kaalaja [G]ghaala re,        Jhelala [F]bhaala re,
gagan bhari [Dm]jhaale [A]re,        [A]Adhir man [Dm]jhaa [A]le...
[Am]Sosala [E]waara [Am]mi,        [Am]jhelalya [E]dhaara [Am]mi
Pyaayala [A]paara [G]mi bahakale [E]na,        [Am]Gaawachya [E]poraa [Am]nni,
[Am]raanaachya [E]moraa [Am]nni,        Shiwaari [A]sayaa [G]nni, paahile [E]na
[Am]Uthhali re, hul hi [G]uthhali re,        Chaalarit [F]sutali re,
nilaajari [Dm]jhaali [A]re,        [A]Adhir man [Dm]jhaa [A]le...
